  {
    "id": 2019008110010,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あれ？　プロデューサー？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……愛依？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110020,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "どしたん？　こんなところで\r\n休憩とか？　じゃないよね？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040190030",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "056",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……\r\n車のバッテリーが上がっちゃってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110030,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "え！　うちを送ってくれた後！？\r\nそれからずっとここにいるカンジ！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実はそうなんだ\r\n今、業者が来るのを待っているところで……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110040,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あちゃー、そりゃ災難だったね～\r\nすぐ来る？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーと……あと、１時間くらいかな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110050,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そんなに！？\r\nヤバくない！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110060,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あー、じゃあその間、うち来る？\r\nこんな暗いとこで待つの、嫌っしょ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう。でも──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──あ、もしかして疲れてるから歩くのキツい？\r\nだったら、うちの自転車乗っていーよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はは、嬉しいよ\r\nでもここで待たないといけないから……ありがとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110080,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あ～、そっかぁ……\r\n！　じゃ、業者の人来るまで、うちとダベろう♪",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、それは愛依に悪いよ\r\nそれにもう遅いんだし──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──いーって、いーって！\r\n家、そんな遠くないから",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもな──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110100,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "『母さんへ\r\nプロデューサーとダベってくから、少し遅くなる～』",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0377",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110110,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "メッセなら送ったから、ほら！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
