  {
    "id": 2019008110120,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──でね、最近弟の学校で何故かしりとりが\r\n流行ってるらしくてさ～",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小学生の時って\r\n理由もなく『なんで！』ってものが流行ったりするよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110130,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そうそう！\r\nそれでうちにもよく勝負仕掛けてくるんだけど～",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110140,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "何言っても『り』でばっか返してきて！\r\nちょーイジワルじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それも立派な作戦じゃないか\r\n愛依も何かしら考えないと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110150,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あ～、言ったな～\r\nじゃあプロデューサー、うちとしりとりしよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、いいぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110160,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "それじゃね～\r\n『てるてる坊主』",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あぁ～\r\nあの時は次の日から見事に晴れたよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110170,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ね！　あそこまで効果あるなんてびっくりしたし！\r\n雨降ったらまた作ろ～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ！　で、『ず』だよな……\r\n『ずんだ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110180,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うーん……\r\nあ！　『た』でもいい？",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110190,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "『竹ランプ』！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな……\r\nけど、あのカフェ、また行きたいよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019008110200,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ねー、今度はお仕事じゃなくて\r\n普通に行ってみたいし！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900811/2019008110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……とと、ついつい脱線しちゃうな、じゃあ次は……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
